1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,045
You can teleport anywhere on Earth.

2
00:00:02,627 --> 00:00:04,352
So you jump from Los Angeles

3
00:00:04,452 --> 00:00:04,973
to London...

4
00:00:05,495 --> 00:00:07,199
and slam sideways into a wall.

5
00:00:08,162 --> 00:00:09,004
Earth spins.

6
00:00:09,685 --> 00:00:11,450
LA moves at about fourteen hundred

7
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,392
kilometres an hour.

8
00:00:12,893 --> 00:00:14,056
London moves slower...

9
00:00:14,557 --> 00:00:15,580
in a different direction.

10
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,548
You arrive still carrying LA's speed.

11
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:21,097
Over two thousand kilometres an hour,

12
00:00:21,519 --> 00:00:21,920
sideways.

13
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,329
And appearing where air already is

14
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,540
shoves it aside with a thunderclap.

15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,566
Try the top of Everest instead?

16
00:00:28,928 --> 00:00:30,374
The air is so thin you'd

17
00:00:30,414 --> 00:00:31,900
pass out in about two minutes.

18
00:00:32,341 --> 00:00:34,107
The only safe jumps are short

19
00:00:34,207 --> 00:00:34,388
ones.

20
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,374
So you grab your coffee in

21
00:00:36,494 --> 00:00:36,795
LA...

22
00:00:37,136 --> 00:00:38,220
and teleport to London.

